gantt
    title Sigma Rule Validation & Deployment
    dateFormat  X
    axisFormat %d
    section Creation
    Rule Drafting            :active, a1, 0, 1
    Syntax Check             :after a1, 1d
    section Backtesting
    Query Compilation        :c1, after a1, 2d
    Historical Run           :after c1, 3d
    section Deployment
    SIEM Promotion           :after c1, 5d